  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/de598b3df8f1384155983bb22d9eea857236fdc12c9ec48dc1276d47b1e67484/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c6448353268472e706e67\" alt=\"\" width=\"1215\" height=\"604\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Flux Networks&nbsp;作者：SonarSonic</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>描述：</strong>Flux Networks 讓你能夠建立無線能量網路。你可以自訂這些網路，並管理世界各處的能源流動。無需佈滿電線，從而減少遊戲延遲並節省你的時間。能源還能跨維度傳輸，讓能源管理變得更加簡單。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主要功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">跨維度無線傳輸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">自動能源轉換</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">無限傳輸速率</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">支援 Forge Energy、EU、AE2 與 IE</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">跨維度背包充能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">使用密碼保護加密你的網路</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">設定網路優先級順序</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">為你的網路命名並設定顏色。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">為每個連接點命名，方便識別。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">設定允許存取你網路的玩家</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">圖表監控近期的能源尖峰／驟降</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">無線編輯所有連接點的設定</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">每個連接點提供區塊載入功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">超級管理員：可刪除不活躍的網路、轉移所有權等。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>截圖：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/1ZVtXlg3MvBIGQH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"398\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/reLOqVAwiDTaQvx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"392\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/6FdKngioTEyaB5N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"409\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/QlBPcfvV15pjzs4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"397\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/11/06/4viGd9P3nUBZxLV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"765\" height=\"469\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>4.0.7 版本以上</strong></span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Flux Networks 已由 BloCamLimb 重新編寫。新版本更適合伺服器使用，且不再需要 SonarCore。原版的大多數功能仍保留，但部分功能可能尚未重新實作或略有調整。不過也加入了許多新功能！<br>了解更多請點<a href=\"https://github.com/SonarSonic/Flux-Networks/tree/1.12.2-refactored\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>V</strong><strong>ersion 3.0.19 版本及以下：</strong>所有這些版本<strong>皆需<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sonar-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Sonar Core</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>1.7.10 版本：</strong>請見 <a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/calculator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Calculator</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>整合包：</strong>歡迎在任何整合包中使用此模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>問題回報：</strong>請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/SonarSonic/Flux-Networks/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 頁面</a> 回報所有問題。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">有任何問題或建議？&nbsp;歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JVkVCV7\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器！</a></span></p>",
